<title>USA: St Paul hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Monday, were $0.50 higher. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	  220-250 lbs    57.00</p>
<p>			250-260 lbs    56.50-57.00</p>
<p>			260-270 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3	  270-280 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>    US 2-4	  280-290 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4	  290-300 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00-2.00. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    46.00-49.00</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
</text>
